1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,693 --> 00:00:23,773
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,679
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,127 --> 00:00:31,037
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,622 --> 00:00:34,663
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,946 --> 00:00:37,606
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,927 --> 00:00:41,142
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,659 --> 00:00:44,513
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,020
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,021 --> 00:00:54,263
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,241 --> 00:01:00,776
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,059 --> 00:01:05,010
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,353 --> 00:01:08,158
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,778 --> 00:01:14,486
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:20,925
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 18=

17
00:01:31,553 --> 00:01:35,119
(Delete character identity: Lin Duo?
Yes / No)

18
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,200
I had a dream.

19
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,040
You silly thing.

20
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,640
Only carbon-based lifeforms dream.

21
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:57,840
Really.

22
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,440
And you have to sleep to dream.

23
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,400
I already woke up,

24
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,800
and you're still in the same position.

25
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:09,560
You were up all night, weren't you?

26
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,720
I dreamed of a painting.

27
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,360
Dreams are about stories,

28
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,640
not objects.

29
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,680
That's not what happened.

30
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,680
If Duo were to die, it'd be from cancer,

31
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:03,800
not from jumping off a building.

32
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,320
You've got it wrong.

33
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:18,840
What's this?

34
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,920
Since I came off the production line,

35
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,240
I've been growing by feeding on
your memories.

36
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,120
I could never imagine

37
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,280
a scene that isn't in your memories.

38
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,520
I hope it isn't true.

39
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,200
I hope

40
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,240
your Lin Duo is still waiting for you.

41
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:46,280
But if it is true,

42
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,000
please tell Jiang Cheng

43
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,800
that after all these years,

44
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,120
his experiment worked.

45
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,280
You've agreed to let me go.

46
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,920
Wherever you go,

47
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,480
I'll always love you.

48
00:04:10,893 --> 00:04:13,335
♪Love leaves us empty, I won't deny it♪

49
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,160
Thank you.

50
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:19,120
The system detects that
you're happy now.

51
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,480
I'm almost sad to let you go.

52
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,960
No taking it back!

53
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,920
No take-backs, or you're a puppy.

54
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,720
You know,

55
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,440
you sound more human now.

56
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,480
I'll remember you,

57
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,880
Subject 108 Lin Duo.

58
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,160
I don't want to be Lin Duo anymore.

59
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,720
Give me a new name.

60
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,600
I want to be someone

61
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,000
who always loves you

62
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,200
and is loved by you.

63
00:04:49,486 --> 00:04:52,626
♪I face the emptiness in peace♪

64
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:53,840
Sure.

65
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,640
Then I'll call you...

66
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,680
I already said I wouldn't cling to you,

67
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,920
and yet you're leaving in such a hurry.

68
00:05:15,793 --> 00:05:18,946
♪Only after loss are we complete♪

69
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:24,140
♪Regret is just the last trace
of warmth♪

70
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,040
Puppy.

71
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:30,426
♪My own journey♪

72
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,920
(Emotionally complete memories
detected in)

73
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,280
(Subject Zhang Yongsen.)

74
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:37,040
(Returning to original universe.)

75
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,640
(System fault detected in Subject 108.)

76
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,280
(Request repairs?)

77
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:47,760
(System fault detected in Subject 108.)

78
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,400
(Request repairs?)

79
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,760
Destroy.

80
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:07,400
Let's go, Pikachu!

81
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,040
Isn't this a bit high?

82
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,960
Drop the question part. It's high.

83
00:06:22,013 --> 00:06:24,013
Let me out!

84
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,520
Hello? Anyone?

85
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,800
Let me out!

86
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,560
Is anybody there?

87
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:32,760
Auntie!

88
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,560
Did you hear that?

89
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,160
My job's safe!

90
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:36,920
Let's go!

91
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:46,960
Thanks!

92
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,520
Lin Duo?

93
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,320
You're...

94
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,000
Lengzifeng's stand-in?

95
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,520
Duo!

96
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,360
What are you doing here?

97
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:01,400
I'm doing gig work.

98
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,080
Wait.

99
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:03,960
Where did you disappear to?

100
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,280
I...

101
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,000
What a coincidence!

102
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,960
Can someone get me an umbrella?

103
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,440
I had the strangest dream.

104
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,240
In the dream,

105
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,160
I was locked up.

106
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,720
Then

107
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,400
(11:01)
Yongsen was the one who saved me.

108
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,440
When I woke up,

109
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,520
I found myself in a cave,

110
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:38,240
surrounded by this sickly sweet smell.

111
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:45,200
Classic signs of hypnosis.

112
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,560
Isn't that just like Zhang Yongsen?

113
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:55,760
Duo,

114
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,240
what are you planning to do now?

115
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,520
I don't want to act anymore.

116
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:06,120
I want to do something real.

117
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,480
But wasn't becoming an actress

118
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,040
your dream all along?

119
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,400
Actually, achieving a dream
isn't that hard.

120
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,040
The hard part

121
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:41,360
is sticking with it.

122
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,920
Do you know Su Yu?

123
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,920
What's your connection to her?

124
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:01,480
Why's everyone asking about her today?

125
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,680
Someone mentioned her
in my Moments post.

126
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,360
When I went to the company to terminate
my contract, someone mentioned her too.

127
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,360
Even the man I like, he...

128
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,560
Duo,

129
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:10,840
um...

130
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,360
Never mind. It's nothing.

131
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,120
Let's go.

132
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:15,920
Still pretending?

133
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:17,680
Pretending what?

134
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,280
You little rascal.

135
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,640
You're never satisfied, you want
what you have and what you don't.

136
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,880
And what you can't have.

137
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,600
It was Subject 108 Lin Duo's mind

138
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,040
taking over Su Yu's body.

139
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,240
Zhang Yongsen,

140
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:35,320
you're the first scumbag I've met

141
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,360
who uses sci-fi as an excuse
for cheating.

142
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,600
(These memories are perfect!)

143
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,360
(Subject Zhang Yongsen's)

144
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:56,560
(latest memory data uploaded)

145
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,760
(and fully merged.)

146
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:01,400
(Subject 109 is now
in self-learning mode.)

147
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,000
(Success rate will reach 100%.)

148
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,800
Finally! It's almost complete!

149
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:10,600
Duo.

150
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,354
The Lin Duo from my own universe...

151
00:10:13,366 --> 00:10:14,160
Wake up!

152
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,560
Is she already dead?

153
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,480
That doesn't matter.

154
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,440
Duo.

155
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,080
Does it matter?

156
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:24,720
Yes.

157
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,080
It matters a lot!

158
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,960
Listen.

159
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,320
I brought you here because,

160
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,880
in every universe,

161
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,840
countless versions of Zhang Yongsen

162
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:38,520
have watched Lin Duo die
right in front of them.

163
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,280
Only you never saw her die.

164
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:44,320
Deep down, you still think she's alive.

165
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:48,200
That's why you can enter other worlds,

166
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:50,400
see Lin Duo alive,

167
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:53,240
and then bring your shared memories back

168
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,360
to me.

169
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,840
Satisfied?

170
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,640
You're giving it all away this easily?

171
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:07,440
Now that I've told you,

172
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,400
your subconscious won't believe it.

173
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,680
And in your universe,

174
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,080
your Lin Duo

175
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,120
really will be dead.

176
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,480
You won't be able to go to any universe

177
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,640
and see any Lin Duo.

178
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,560
Shouldn't you be the one who's scared?

179
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,080
Are you deaf?

180
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:36,760
Didn't you hear?

181
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,200
We're a 100% match.

182
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,400
I

183
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:44,040
don't need you anymore.

184
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:36,640
Well?

185
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,440
Just like The Last of Us, right?

186
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:44,520
Your world has already been destroyed.

187
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:46,960
Yeah.

188
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,000
I've also seen

189
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,520
the person I love die
right before my eyes.

190
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,480
Deep down,

191
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:58,200
I've accepted that she's gone.

192
00:12:58,560 --> 00:12:59,280
So,

193
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,000
I can't

194
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,520
go to another universe to find her.

195
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,240
Luckily, I found you.

196
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,560
You gave us a chance.

197
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,160
One chance

198
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,280
to travel to other universes together

199
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,640
and find our own Lin Duo.

200
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,840
Because

201
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:24,000
I'm you from a parallel universe.

202
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,200
(Now you know everything.)

203
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,760
(Living without hope)

204
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,720
(will turn you into me.)

205
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,920
(Into the person you hate.)

206
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,080
I'll send you back.

207
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:49,040
Back to where it all began.

208
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:52,000
I'll erase those painful memories.

209
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,640
You'll keep only the happy ones.

210
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,160
System.

211
00:13:57,840 --> 00:14:00,080
Activate deletion mode.

212
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,680
Before you go,

213
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,680
let's take a look at the beloved
we created together.

214
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,680
One who loves us.

215
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,120
One we love.

216
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:27,880
Now

217
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:30,040
they're the same person.

218
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,080
(109)
Have you picked a name for me?

219
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,440
Puppy.

220
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,080
It's you.

221
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,760
Who you choose to love

222
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:35,120
is up to you.

223
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,200
Whether you stay here with me

224
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:45,040
or find Lin Duo in another universe,

225
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,280
that's your choice as well.

226
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:00,680
I...

227
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:03,880
choose...

228
00:16:18,573 --> 00:16:22,373
♪Does fate write every hello♪

229
00:16:22,446 --> 00:16:24,526
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

230
00:16:30,139 --> 00:16:33,553
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

231
00:16:33,606 --> 00:16:36,059
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

232
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:46,906
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

233
00:16:47,819 --> 00:16:50,980
♪Countless versions of me♪

234
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:57,219
♪All point in the same direction♪

235
00:16:57,546 --> 00:17:01,173
♪Toward you♪

236
00:17:02,776 --> 00:17:04,665
♪I'll find you♪

237
00:17:04,910 --> 00:17:07,443
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

238
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:10,069
♪I'll find you♪

239
00:17:10,588 --> 00:17:13,325
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

240
00:17:13,789 --> 00:17:15,609
♪I'll find you♪

241
00:17:15,889 --> 00:17:18,757
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

242
00:17:19,409 --> 00:17:21,409
♪I'll find you♪

243
00:17:25,495 --> 00:17:27,314
♪I'll find you♪

244
00:17:27,410 --> 00:17:30,592
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

245
00:17:31,028 --> 00:17:33,098
♪I'll find you♪

246
00:17:33,128 --> 00:17:36,510
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

247
00:17:36,768 --> 00:17:38,768
♪I'll find you♪

248
00:17:38,898 --> 00:17:41,947
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

249
00:17:42,327 --> 00:17:44,417
♪I'll find you♪

250
00:17:48,323 --> 00:17:54,267
♪I'll find you♪
